)
+IT_size/BE_size*ITBE_im/BE_ex*BERA_rer*RA_pex*ITRA_im/(BEIT_rer*IT_py*IT_y
+BERA_rer*RA_pex*ITRA_im
+BEAT_rer*AT_pex*ITAT_im
+BEES_rer*ES_pex*ITES_im
