+GRUS_rer*US_pex*RAUS_im
)+
+AT_size/GR_size*ATGR_im/GR_ex*GRRA_rer*RA_pex*ATRA_im/(GRAT_rer*AT_py*AT_y
+GRRA_rer*RA_pex*ATRA_im
+GRBE_rer*BE_pex*ATBE_im
