// Aggregate intermediate-good price dynamics, using NL_px = GR_pim
// GRNL_pim^(1-NL_thetat) = (1-NL_xix)*GRNL_pimtilde^(1-NL_thetat)+NL_xix*(GRNL_pim(-1)/GR_pic)^(1-NL_thetat)*(GRNL_piim(-1)^NL_chix*GR_pi4target^(1/4*(1-NL_chih)))^(1-NL_thetat);
// Intermediate-good price inflation, using NL_pix = GR_piim
